#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:18
msgid ""
"IBM's website is the digital embodiment of enterprise authority built on "
"the Carbon Design System — a design language so methodically structured "
"it reads like an engineering specification rendered as a webpage. The "
"page operates on a stark duality: a bright white (`#ffffff`) canvas with "
"near-black (`#161616`) text, punctuated by a single, unwavering accent — "
"IBM Blue 60 (`#0f62fe`). This isn't playful tech-startup minimalism; it's"
" corporate precision distilled into pixels. Every element exists within "
"Carbon's rigid 2x grid, every color maps to a semantic token, every "
"spacing value snaps to the 8px base unit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:20
msgid ""
"The IBM Plex type family is the system's backbone. IBM Plex Sans at light"
" weight (300) for display headlines creates an unexpectedly airy, almost "
"delicate quality at large sizes — a deliberate counterpoint to IBM's "
"corporate gravity. At body sizes, regular weight (400) with 0.16px "
"letter-spacing on 14px captions introduces the meticulous micro-tracking "
"that makes Carbon text feel engineered rather than designed. IBM Plex "
"Mono serves code, data, and technical labels, completing the family "
"trinity alongside the rarely-surfaced IBM Plex Serif."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:22
msgid ""
"What defines IBM's visual identity beyond monochrome-plus-blue is the "
"reliance on Carbon's component token system. Every interactive state maps"
" to a CSS custom property prefixed with `--cds-` (Carbon Design System). "
"Buttons don't have hardcoded colors; they reference `--cds-button-"
"primary`, `--cds-button-primary-hover`, `--cds-button-primary-active`. "
"This tokenized architecture means the entire visual layer is a thin skin "
"over a deeply systematic foundation — the design equivalent of a well-"
"typed API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:25
msgid ""
"IBM Plex Sans at weight 300 (Light) for display — corporate gravitas "
"through typographic restraint"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:26
msgid ""
"IBM Plex Mono for code and technical content with consistent 0.16px "
"letter-spacing at small sizes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:27
msgid ""
"Single accent color: IBM Blue 60 (`#0f62fe`) — every interactive element,"
" every CTA, every link"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:28
msgid ""
"Carbon token system (`--cds-*`) driving all semantic colors, enabling "
"theme-switching at the variable level"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:29
msgid ""
"8px spacing grid with strict adherence — no arbitrary values, everything "
"aligns"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:30
msgid ""
"Flat, borderless cards on `#f4f4f4` Gray 10 surface — depth through "
"background-color layering, not shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:31
msgid "Bottom-border inputs (not boxed) — the signature Carbon form pattern"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:32
msgid ""
"0px border-radius on primary buttons — unapologetically rectangular, no "
