#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:257
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Carbon is deliberately shadow-averse. IBM achieves"
" depth primarily through background-color layering — stacking surfaces of"
" progressively darker grays rather than adding box-shadows. This creates "
"a flat, print-inspired aesthetic where hierarchy is communicated through "
"color value, not simulated light. Shadows are reserved exclusively for "
"floating elements (dropdowns, tooltips, modals) where the element "
"genuinely overlaps content. This restraint gives the rare shadow "
"meaningful impact — when something floats in Carbon, it matters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:259
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:261
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:262
msgid ""
"Use IBM Plex Sans at weight 300 for display sizes (42px+) — the lightness"
" is intentional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:263
msgid "Apply 0.16px letter-spacing on 14px body text and 0.32px on 12px captions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:264
msgid ""
"Use 0px border-radius on buttons, inputs, cards, and tiles — rectangles "
"are the system"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:265
msgid ""
"Reference `--cds-*` token names when implementing (e.g., `--cds-button-"
"primary`, `--cds-text-primary`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:266
msgid ""
"Use background-color layering (white → gray 10 → gray 20) for depth "
"instead of shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:267
msgid "Use bottom-border (not box) for input field indicators"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:268
msgid ""
"Maintain the 48px default button height and asymmetric padding for icon "
"accommodation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:269
msgid "Apply Blue 60 (`#0f62fe`) as the sole accent — one blue to rule them all"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:271
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:272
msgid "Don't round button corners — 0px radius is the Carbon identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:273
msgid "Don't use shadows on cards or tiles — flatness is the point"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:274
msgid ""
"Don't introduce additional accent colors — IBM's system is monochromatic "
"+ blue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:275
msgid "Don't use weight 700 (Bold) — the scale stops at 600 (Semibold)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:276
msgid ""
"Don't add letter-spacing to display-size text — tracking is only for 14px"
" and below"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:277
msgid "Don't box inputs with full borders — Carbon inputs use bottom-border only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:278
msgid "Don't use gradient backgrounds — IBM's surfaces are flat, solid colors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_ibm.md:279
msgid ""
"Don't deviate from the 8px spacing grid — every value should be divisible"
" by 8 (with 2px and 4px for micro-adjustments)"
msgstr ""

